VALUES (gen_random_uuid()::text, $q$tiger-backwoods-golf$q$, $q$Golf: Blockchain Golf Game$q$, $q$A client built golf game for the web with a Web3 layer running in the background. It has multiple levels, different clubs for different shots, and a light multiplayer feature where two players compare stats and progress.$q$, $q$Multiplayer & Sports$q$, ARRAY[$q$Sports$q$, $q$Golf$q$, $q$Blockchain$q$, $q$Web3$q$, $q$WebGL$q$, $q$Unity$q$]::text[], $q$Unity 6, C#, Solana Unity SDK, Firebase, Firebase Cloud Functions, WebGL$q$, $q$2025$q$, $q$⛳$q$, $q$#065f46$q$, true, 3, $q$GAME$q$, $q$COMPANY$q$, $q$Gameplay and Unity developer$q$, $q$I handled gameplay, the blockchain and cloud connections, and the level setup. Web3 and smart contracts run in the background through Solana, and Firebase Cloud Functions handle the cloud API calls.$q$, ARRAY[$q$Golf gameplay with multiple levels and different club types for different shots$q$, $q$Terrain based golf environments$q$, $q$Solana integration for the Web3 side$q$, $q$Firebase integration and cloud functions for backend API work$q$, $q$Basic two player progress and stats comparison (text based, not live play)$q$, $q$Input and interface setup$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$Me$q$, $q$One 3D artist$q$, $q$One game designer$q$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[$q$Multiple levels$q$, $q$Different golf clubs for different shot types$q$, $q$Blockchain connected features$q$, $q$Two player stats and progress comparison$q$, $q$WebGL build$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$Smart contract and Solana work running behind the scenes$q$, $q$Firebase Cloud Functions used as the cloud API layer$q$, $q$Built on Unity 6 with URP, terrain tools and the new Input System$q$]::text[], $q$WebGL, with other builds configured$q$, false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
