VALUES (gen_random_uuid()::text, $q$we-are-cooked-hotel-sim$q$, $q$We Are Cooked: Hotel Shift Simulator$q$, $q$A first person hotel simulator where you work timed shifts delivering luggage, serving room service and cleaning rooms while keeping guests happy. It is released on the App Store.$q$, $q$Simulation$q$, ARRAY[$q$First person$q$, $q$Simulation$q$, $q$Time Management$q$, $q$Mobile$q$, $q$Unity$q$]::text[], $q$Unity 6, C#, URP, Unity Input System, Unity AI Navigation, AppLovin MAX, Unity IAP$q$, $q$2026$q$, $q$🛎️$q$, $q$#c2410c$q$, true, 5, $q$GAME$q$, $q$COMPANY$q$, $q$Gameplay and systems programmer$q$, $q$I built the core hotel loop, the movement and interaction systems, the guest flow, the economy and the monetization.$q$, ARRAY[$q$First person movement with walk, sprint, crouch and jump, plus keyboard, touch and joystick support$q$, $q$Interaction system with focus, hold to pick up and prompts$q$, $q$Guest reception queue, room assignment and checkout using NavMesh$q$, $q$Four minute shifts with task queues, ratings, tips, strikes and scorecards$q$, $q$Luggage, room service and housekeeping tasks$q$, $q$XP, ranks, coins and saved progress$q$, $q$Ads through AppLovin MAX and in app purchases for remove ads and bundles$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$Me$q$, $q$One 3D artist$q$, $q$One game designer$q$]::text[], $q$Released on the App Store.$q$, ARRAY[$q$Guest queue and room assignment$q$, $q$Luggage trolley delivery$q$, $q$Room service food delivery$q$, $q$Dynamic cleaning tasks$q$, $q$Ratings, tips, strikes and career progression$q$, $q$Pick up, drop and throw interactions$q$, $q$Rewarded ads and remove ads purchase$q$, $q$Mobile touch controls$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$Shift manager prioritizes tasks and produces an end of shift summary$q$, $q$Guests move with NavMesh agents and queue slots$q$, $q$Character controller with coyote time, jump buffering and slope handling$q$, $q$JSON save system synced with PlayerPrefs$q$, $q$Ad behaviour controlled remotely with Unity Remote Config$q$]::text[], $q$Mobile and desktop$q$, false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
