VALUES (gen_random_uuid()::text, $q$world-war-zombies$q$, $q$World War I: Zombie Frontline$q$, $q$A World War I shooter with a fixed view where zombies come at you in waves. You survive with different weapons and perks, with zombie tiers and boss encounters getting harder over time.$q$, $q$Action & Shooter$q$, ARRAY[$q$Shooter$q$, $q$Zombies$q$, $q$WW1$q$, $q$Mobile$q$, $q$Unity$q$, $q$Wave Survival$q$]::text[], $q$Unity, C#, URP, Unity AI Navigation, Unity IAP, AppLovin MAX$q$, $q$2026$q$, $q$🪖$q$, $q$#374151$q$, true, 12, $q$GAME$q$, $q$PERSONAL$q$, $q$Gameplay programmer and systems developer$q$, $q$I built the wave system, the zombie behaviour and the perks, plus the UI and monetization, and worked with a 3D artist on the environment.$q$, ARRAY[$q$Wave system with zombie spawning and growing difficulty$q$, $q$Zombie tiers with their own models, animations and boss variants$q$, $q$Weapon setup with rifles, pistols, shotguns, snipers and grenades$q$, $q$Perks such as rapid fire, double points, instant kills and infinite ammo$q$, $q$Revive flow, menus and onboarding$q$, $q$Ads and in app purchases$q$, $q$Sound and visual effects$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$Me$q$, $q$One 3D artist$q$]::text[], NULL, ARRAY[$q$Wave based zombie survival$q$, $q$Boss zombies$q$, $q$Weapon unlocks, including rewarded ad unlocks$q$, $q$Perks and temporary power ups$q$, $q$Revive system$q$, $q$Mobile touch controls$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$NavMesh movement for zombies$q$, $q$Spawning, behaviour, health and animation kept in separate systems$q$, $q$Ads, purchases and saves separated from gameplay code$q$]::text[], $q$Mobile and PC$q$, false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
