VALUES (gen_random_uuid()::text, $q$over-the-top-grapple-runner$q$, $q$OverTheTop: One Button Climbing Game$q$, $q$A game made for the Softcom 2026 game jam under the theme “one button”. The goal is to reach the top, and every mechanic in the game runs from a single button. It won the jam.$q$, $q$Platformer & Arcade$q$, ARRAY[$q$Game Jam$q$, $q$Arcade$q$, $q$One Button$q$, $q$Unity$q$]::text[], $q$Unity, C#$q$, $q$2026$q$, $q$🪝$q$, $q$#0f766e$q$, true, 4, $q$GAME$q$, $q$HACKATHON$q$, $q$Developer and game designer$q$, $q$I built the game and designed the single button mechanic system, working with a UI/UX artist on the visuals and interface.$q$, ARRAY[$q$The full gameplay built around one input$q$, $q$Game design and progression to the top$q$, $q$Integration of the UI/UX artist’s interface$q$]::text[], ARRAY[$q$Me (developer and designer)$q$, $q$One UI/UX artist$q$]::text[], $q$Winner of the Softcom 2026 game jam.$q$, ARRAY[$q$Entire game controlled with one button$q$, $q$Climb to the top challenge$q$, $q$Designed and built within game jam time$q$]::text[], ARRAY[]::text[], NULL, false, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)
